        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Traditional Fullerton Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fullerton Cabinet Pull from RK International is the perfect accompaniment to any traditional home. It is available in 3 lengths so you will be able to find the perfect fit for your application. It features raised details that really bring out the highlights of the finishes especially on the Valencia Bronze finish and the Brushed English finish. The Fullerton Cabinet Door Pull is available in 7 finishes, to match any decor. It features a zinc construction regardless of finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/traditional-fullerton-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-126\"><b>Matching Fullerton Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-fullerton-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6626\"><b>Matching Fullerton Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-626:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 96 mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CP-627:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-CP-628:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-15/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/oiled-bronze-dragonfly.jpg?v=1704354568\" width\"421\" height=\"206\" border=\"0\" atl=\"RKI International Fullerton Cabinet Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
